        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "These caveats point to future work: (i) quantifying how much multi-epoch and multi-baseline diversity is needed to move Pareto fronts closer to the origin; (ii) combining low-rank decompositions with physical priors or non-linear models of the foregrounds, beam, or instrument; and (iii) extending the synthetic testbed to a broader class of RFI morphologies and to other low-frequency arrays.",
            "block_bbox": [
